  "notes": "Dark near-black ApiArk API client. Uses colour to code HTTP methods: amber POST chips, green GET text, purple GQL chip. Indigo #6366f1 is used only for the primary actions (Send, New) and the selected JSON body type. The response status '201 Created' is shown in bold green with latency and size beside it. Syntax colours follow VS Code Dark+ (light blue keys, salmon strings, yellow numbers). Tabs are nested in three levels: document tabs, request/response sub-tabs, and the body-type segmented control. Blue dots on Scripts/Tests mean they have content. An unprompted 'Tip: Ctrl+Enter' hint covers the response tabs. The response toolbar offers Save for Diff and Compare."
